# The version recipe. Renovate bumps it, and a merged bump rebuilds the image.
# No kernel, pkgs or extension pin: lib/resolve_inputs.sh derives them from TALOS_VERSION. See docs/kernel.md.

## The Talos release everything else is rebased onto.
# renovate: datasource=github-releases depName=siderolabs/talos
TALOS_VERSION="v1.14.5"

## The Pi 5 boot chain: U-Boot, DTBs, config.txt. A bare commit SHA, because the repo has no tags.
SBCOVERLAY_VERSION="7d04484be2beb4b1fca56538d2b6d07e7d58681f"

## No extension pins: lib/resolve_inputs.sh takes iscsi-tools and util-linux-tools at the digests siderolabs
## released with TALOS_VERSION.
